    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, given an etherknight’s lay on hands applies a limited number of mercies rather than all known mercies at once, the Extra Mercy feat is treated as though it has the following Benefit: text rather than what is listed in its entry,<br>\n“Select one additional mercy for which you qualify. You can also use your lay on hands ability one additional time per day.”</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/etherknight#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
